      "data": {
        "text": "**Selecting the Provider**\n\nI've decided on Google Cloud Document AI as the provider for layout extraction. Now, I will ensure its usage is clearly identifiable within the `extract_layout.py` file. I am going to focus on integrating the Document AI client library specifically.\n\n\n**Defining the Python File**\n\nI've begun by establishing the `extract_layout.py` file, the core of the layout extraction process. Google Cloud Document AI has been selected and will be the focus. I'm prioritizing the implementation of the Document AI client library within the file to handle document analysis.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789861522382,
          "start": 1789861517393
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc0f5851001X2iaEBNm8hhOWN",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc0f53f8001wmfeY0j6oOlW4P",
